# Prometheus Redis Exporter configuration.
# Controls the command-line arguments passed to the prometheus-redis-exporter process.
#
# WARNING: Due to shell escaping rules, special characters in regex patterns require
# extra care.
# - To pass a literal backslash for regexes, you must double them: use '\\d' to get '\d'.
# - If this configuration is managed by systemd, systemd performs an additional level
#   of escaping. Therefore, you may need to double them again: use '\\\\d' to finally
#   achieve '\d' in the actual command line.
# - Newlines must also be escaped appropriately if included.

# Set the command-line arguments to pass to the prometheus-redis-exporter server.
# Variable: args (default: '')
ARGS="{{ args | default('') }}"